{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_nothin_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_nothin_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"落水人","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_nothin_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"83f8a97611c1c7890a52113058b062b4f2f083c390fc6f6e5ba7b4abdafeed69","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"決定告別勾吳城的前夕，烏有意外捲入一場風波，獲得了與師門相關的消息。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"wuyou"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荊先生，荊兄，這一杯，就祝你前程似錦，告別每天擺路邊攤的生活，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，正有此意，乾杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去哪兒，想好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒呢，就是決定走得遠一點，一邊走一邊找機遇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你說，你已經去過勾吳城裡面了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，勾吳城周圍的鎮子，我也都走遍了，可惜哪兒都混不下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這裡你也混不下去？我記得你好像來這裡還沒多久哇，是不是還沒體會到我們雲水鎮的好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算啦，誰沒點難處呢？我不也找不到工作嘛，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，再來一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，別急著喝，喝多了怎麼幫我寫信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對對對，還有寫信這回事。那我現在先幫你寫了，不耽誤咱們喝酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，紙和筆。筆還拿得穩嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然。寫什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......你就寫，“楚師弟得貴人提攜，飛黃騰達”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這個“攜”字怎麼寫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沾點酒寫給你看。就這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你這兒少了一橫......算了，也沒事，接著寫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“此去京城三千里，山高水遠，請二老莫要牽掛。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，這個師弟，是你什麼人？有這種好事，怎麼不捎上你一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......一塊學做鉗獸粉絲煲的師弟，他做得好，進京給人當大廚去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，但是當大廚可就有講究了。天南地北的菜系不計其數，互相見了就要掐架不說，同門之間呢，還要論你的菜正不正宗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼嚇人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就想想，京城許多人，只許人吃砂糖粽子，不許人吃鹹粽子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那還真挺嚇人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說嘛，這裡面水深，我不樂意蹚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，但我看你每天在街邊擺攤，從算命看風水到賣炸豆腐串，沒看出你跟大廚有什麼關係啊？該不會是這師弟嫌你學藝不精，不理你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，這話我可不愛聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這師弟在大廚門下時，我們當師兄師姐的可沒少照拂他。他這次要背井離鄉，心裡還掛念著同門情分呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他四處找人陪他，想著無論去了哪裡至少有個幫襯，可惜，這條路太難走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到頭來，他只能托人寫一封家書。你看，我這不就是跟他關係最好，所以替他寫信嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......好像有點道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那接下來怎麼寫？你那師弟，什麼時候把父母接去京城玩？或者什麼時候能回家看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......那可真沒個准信兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這封就這樣吧。你再幫我寫一封別的，咱們接著喝兩壺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌櫃的，加酒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟好義氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是當然，咱們這關係，我走之前可不得喝個夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，這封你就寫，“令郎已死，屏息噤聲，莫要涉足江湖事端”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"令郎......已死......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓......咱們也別問就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？呃，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我有點不明白了。你字寫得挺好的，為什麼要我幫你寫信——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"砸、砸場子的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，可怕可怕。還好我跑得快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......這是哪兒？這客棧還有這麼一條路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，情急之中就撞進來了，我也不知道是哪兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小子，還不上酒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是、是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你這櫃檯裡，就收了這麼點錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......大冬天的，生意不景氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"窮酸生意，倒敢挑三揀四。大小姐不嫌你砢磣，你倒是嫌薊家的門檻高，你邁不過去腿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（薊家......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，又是那幫人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兒女情長的事。勾吳城裡的薊家大小姐一眼相中了掌櫃的，可掌櫃的對她沒那個意思，所以那大小姐時不時就派人來鬧事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，原來是有了別的意中人。這土裡土氣的銀鐲子，不知道是準備送給誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇惡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就替大小姐把這東西收走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，怎麼能讓他們這麼欺負人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，這掌櫃的幹嘛不答應呢？一夜之間，榮華富貴，應有盡有啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老兄，你這是什麼話？咱們雖然窮，也得有骨氣啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依我看，我們現在就應該衝出去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我們報個官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，可千萬不能輕舉妄動啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖說那掌櫃的確實是對我們有恩，可我一個看風水的，衝出去也無能為力啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，薊家可是勾吳城裡的大戶人家，萬一得罪了，怕是要被追殺到天涯海角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，也對。掌櫃的，對不住了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g05_mountaincity_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風水占卜，針灸按摩，荊氏百年秘傳，客官——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——欸，掌櫃的。嘿嘿，您身體怎麼樣？跌打損傷貼要來一貼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我來問風水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題，覓氣尋地，消災積福，包在我身上，您請問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正是想請先生幫我尋一個消災的法子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不知道是哪種災......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道的，荊先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你欠著債，要用錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，對對對，是有這麼回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前那些來追殺......追債的人，實在兇殘，多謝掌櫃的給我指了一道暗門，讓我藏身半日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時我要磕頭謝恩，您不肯受，這會兒我給您補三個響頭——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生不必如此。只是此次我肯破財消災，還請先生不吝幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一隻舊手鐲，昨天被人拿了去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐲子不算名貴，卻是家母留的一個紀念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來不是送人的信物。我記得令堂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"錢財都在其次，我只求把這件紀念取回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......寄託了如此哀思的物件，竟然被歹人奪去，實在令人心痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜，這不是風水能尋的東西，我愛莫能助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，掌櫃的，昨天夜裡我已經報過官了，你再等等，應該很快就有消息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些鬧事的人知道分寸。我報過幾次，一來取不到證據，二來事情也不足以立案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，一隻銀鐲子，在薊家的貴人眼裡，實在不值一提。我怕他們隨手就把那鐲子扔到不知哪裡去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我想請先生替我出手，把那隻鐲子買回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚先生......勉強算是在場，假稱是一眼看中了銀鐲子想要買下，應該不會招惹到那些貴人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，錢我出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這等闊氣的事，從我口中說出恐怕不像真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌櫃的，要不您再斟酌一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生的意思是，不肯出頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，還不敢死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——哈哈哈，我嘛，即使有行俠仗義之心，也沒有那個能力呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，遺憾。我看你總拿著把扇子，以為你也是位俠士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“也是”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，這都什麼時代了，還有人自稱俠士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的。前兩年鎮子上來過一位年紀輕輕的女俠，平日裡最愛替人打抱不平，一扇子就能敲昏一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過後來聽說是撞上了薊家的人，唉，人就不見啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，所以你真沒有什麼，江湖奇術，獨門源石技藝之類的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那哪兒能有呢，要是有的話，我不就去當天師了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你這堪輿之術......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，這是學問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我對自己的字還有點信心——要不我給您也寫個扇面？您看是要“日進斗金”還是“和氣生財”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，大冬天的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，您說的是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌櫃的，這薊家的打手，我要去哪裡找？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g02_yanalley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。車子買好了，信使的身份做好了，給父母的信也寄了，這節骨眼上可別出什麼亂子啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那姓薊的雖然與師父有仇......但只是兩個來找掌櫃麻煩的打手，應該還是認不出我的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算被認出來了，也不過就是再逃跑一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不知道師姐是死是活。要是真能找到師兄師姐的下落，行走江湖也算有個幫襯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，二位，多有打擾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薊家打手","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算命的，跑到這裡來做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實不相瞞，昨日二位不是在如意酒家替大小姐教訓那不知好歹的窮小子嘛，我剛好在場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薊家打手","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......店裡沒人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後廚，我在後廚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別誤會，我覺得你們做得好，做得特別好，那小子真是不識相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薊家打手","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼，有話直說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，那我可說了......那掌櫃的銀鐲子，就是桌上你們壓著泡麵的這件，不知道你們願不願意轉個手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依我之見，這東西給大小姐帶去，恐怕更教人氣惱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加上這鐲子成色不好，也不是什麼值錢寶貝，恐怕也配不上二位貴人的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......實話跟二位講吧，我想買下這隻鐲子去孝敬我家中的老母親。老人家不喜歡潮流的玩意，就想要這種土裡土氣的設計。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，錢我先放在這兒了，二位若是點頭，我必感激不盡，視二位為恩人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，二位要不來算一卦？免費贈的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這客棧還能停電？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（有暗器？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀！沒想到我竟是災星，這一來就讓客棧停電了......抱歉抱歉，給二位添麻煩了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（真是怪事，怎麼突然要抓我？難道我替掌櫃取貨的意圖太明顯？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗處的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抓住他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......牆後有隔間？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得罪二位了！我這就去找前台報修！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g02_yanalley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......似乎沒人追上來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好還好，沒把自己的命丟在那兒，鐲子也趁黑摸到手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，但掌櫃的恐怕也沒法在這裡久留了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此禍因我而起，卻又要連累他人......楚某人實在慚愧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......剛才客棧裡，隔牆的聲音，真不是我聽錯了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗處的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......使傘的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。是那個姓楚的小子，不會有錯。就算他不用扇子和拳法，我也認得他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暗處的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也難怪幾個人都攔不住他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女性的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我去追貨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，倒是不用打聽師姐的去向了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此路已經不通，待我回酒家交了差，就連夜逃跑吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"掌櫃的，你聽我說——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，荊先生，你來得倒挺巧。你看，這位就是白天我對你提起過的女俠。沒想到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——既然如此巧合，容我給女俠看個手相。來，扇子先放下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......荊先生，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，他這個人就是不著調，女俠請多擔待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就你那手相學問，你之前拉著我說的沒一個字準的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，不也沒收你錢嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，女俠，我與你有眼緣，免費算命。你需要的話，等會兒還能送你一卦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"先生請說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看女俠的手相，少年時應該是在勾吳城裡面生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這我倒也會說，先生你也是勾吳城人士，一眼便知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話總要從淺的開始說嘛。我接著說，女俠命中有一位恩人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"許多人對我有恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位恩人，不是父母，卻影響女俠十餘年——女俠想必有一位恩師吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那恩師想必常說，人間這麼多冤枉事，總要有人給它們一個清白，所以女俠才成為這雲水鎮百姓眼中的俠士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......大意沒有錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這不是合理推斷嘛。誰沒上過學啊，哪個老師不會教你一點做人的道理啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不是推斷出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女俠，實不相瞞，此處有凶相。冒昧問一句，近年來你可曾回去探望過這位恩人？......你可還惦記著她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......她死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死了？好生可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......恩師年事已高，還和年輕時一樣，執意涉水渡江。江水漲潮，浪頭沖過來，她撐不住，就沒再從水裡站起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，那她可真是個糊塗人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"借風借水，順水推舟，這才是聰明人，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"不去水邊走，才是聰明人。前兩年江上大潮，也有觀潮人被捲了進去，死生不知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......就算真有人尋到下落，恐怕也只剩一具屍體吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，官府每年都發通告提醒，可隔三岔五的還是要出些事故。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，可惜可惜。平日我在水邊釣魚，聽到有人落水，我還忍不住幫忙去撈呢，就是撈不著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看不出先生還有這份熱心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，死生事大嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒相信先生是講義氣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"還請先生幫我卜一下未來之事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，對對，我看看啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未來可就不好說了，女俠命裡有道坎，但也不難跨過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可別來你破財消災那一套了，說點好聽的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女俠一來行俠仗義，二來對人有恩，老天爺大概也不願意讓你遭災——聽聽，這句吉祥話不收錢的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這行俠仗義和對人有恩，不是一回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，咱們在這兒聊了半天了，要不拿點酒來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。我這心事重重的，連招待的事情都忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，我這兒還有一件事想說給女俠聽，我去取好酒來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我鬆手了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"許久沒有切磋武藝，還請師弟多多指教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師姐，得罪！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"師父，飯我燒好了。鉗獸粉絲煲，我打工的時候跟頭牌大廚學的，您嘗嘗？\n想過，當然想過，師父您早就說了，我是廉家武館的關門弟子，等我找到份好差事，您就可以退隱休息了。\n師兄師姐不知都去了哪裡，這兩年也都沒回來看望過您。唉，真想問問他們如今都在哪裡討生活，要是能幫我一把，那就再好不過了。\n......師父教訓得是。這次武館切磋結束之後，我就回家看看爸媽。\n真要是沒出路，我就回去當個莊稼漢。哪怕能為鄉親們驅趕一次野獸，也算不令廉家功夫蒙羞。\n——這廉家功夫，您還未教完？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......承讓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......你勝了一招。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身負重托，不敢死罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那時候師兄師姐們都走了，只留下我這個最愚鈍的徒弟沒聽到風聲，師父只好把剩下的招式教給了我一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......師父從不看錯人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"她不肯教的，都是取人性命的殺招。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼收手了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切磋武藝，點到為止嘛。俗話說得好，做人留一線，日後好相見，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"你明知道我是受你仇家之托，來取你性命的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道。你要來取兩件貨，一件是掌櫃的銀鐲子，一件是我的項上人頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，但是你也可以跟他們說，那個姓楚的又跑掉了嘛。我都從他們眼皮底下跑了那麼多次了，你又不會輕功，一個人抓不住我也正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼要這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"——因為我“一來行俠仗義，二來對人有恩”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可不是嘛，往年我父母來武館看我的時候，你們就故意在切磋時放水，讓我能贏一兩招，搞得我家裡人到現在還以為我是個練武奇才。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父知道我家鄉那邊常做話梅蜜餞，每次額外準備一些，你們也不跟我搶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真要說起來，師門各位都對我有恩，我楚某人忘不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——而且，被大潮捲進去的落水人，到底是身不由己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你也知道身不由己......卻還想去撈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......師姐，師父是被我害死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論背後有多少算計，那小子是死在我的拳下，師父是為了我這個不爭氣的徒弟......我有愧於師門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父教的功夫，我沒臉用。只有方才師門切磋，是有意請師姐賜教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"......既然同是落水人，你又指望誰來撈你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"但你扇子上的字，我看清了。既然師父要你收下這把扇子，你就不該讓她失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這麼說來，我更不該動手了。師父教的功夫，不應該是用來摻和這些糊塗事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"你真這麼固執？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女俠？","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"那多謝師弟手下留情了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女俠——啊，女俠呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼只有先生一個人站在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"方才外面有打鬧聲，女俠便追出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此。我剛才在酒窖裡，也聽見打鬥聲，又有扇子開合的聲音，想必是女俠出手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜也是，可得躲好了，晚點再出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，掌櫃的，你的鐲子在這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你真去拿了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逝者遺物嘛，丟了總是會讓人痛心的，我只不過將心比心——欸，不過，掌櫃的，報酬可不能少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝多謝，報酬好說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，還有，我勸你最近多加小心，最好趁早離開雲水鎮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你惹他們生氣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，挺生氣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那還真是謝謝您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實在是對不住！掌櫃的，我給您賠個禮，再賠您一卦，您看......可還行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，也罷。薊家盯上了我這小破酒家，這生意本來也不好做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報酬我依之前說好的給你，一分不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，多謝老闆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，掌櫃的，你這裡還有沒有話梅蜜餞剩下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒家掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還剩了不少，你要？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“荊先生”","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，準備出門遠遊，帶點在路上吃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"那姓楚的小子，你沒抓到？\n屬下失職。\n......但是，我見到他連夜從東邊開車逃走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
